其擾（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241208/942470736210300928201876.png/demJ6C8Boz0ZWZfFZfvvYhS1aBU44PzUXKDEbVygxG0\"/><figcaption>日圓貶值大批旅客湧入　日媒盤點最討厭遊客行為　當地居民不堪其擾（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>聯航客機爆乘客試圖「強闖駕駛艙」 全機153人緊急迫降</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T06:19:15.624605+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1683,"images":20,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}